# STIG CD16-00-007000: PostgreSQL must use centralized management of the content captured in audit reco
# STIG ID: V-261917 (MEDIUM)

META
    esp_id `pg16-cd16-00-007000-centralized-audit-mgmt-001`
    version `1.0.0`
    dsl_schema_version `1.0.0`
    platform `pg16`
    criticality `high`

    title `STIG CD16-00-007000: PostgreSQL must use centralized management of the content captured in audit reco`
    description `PostgreSQL must use centralized management of the content captured in audit records generated by all components of PostgreSQL.`
    author `example-security`
    tags `pg16,stig,disa-stig`

    control_mapping `DISA-STIG:CD16-00-007000`
    control_objective `CD16-00-007000`

    assessment_method `TEST`
    implementation_status `implemented`
    responsible_role `dba`

    control_origination `sp-system`
    inherited_from `PostgreSQL16:localhost:pg-hardening`
    customer_responsibility `configuration`

    remediation_days `30`
    recommendation `Review and configure the required PostgreSQL parameters to meet compliance requirements.`

    component_id `comp-pg16-db`

META_END

DEF
    OBJECT pg_param_0
        parameter `log_destination`
    OBJECT_END

    OBJECT pg_param_1
        parameter `syslog_facility`
    OBJECT_END

    STATE state_0
        found boolean = true
    STATE_END

    STATE state_1
        found boolean = true
    STATE_END

    CRI AND
        CTN pg_config_param
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF state_0
            OBJECT_REF pg_param_0
        CTN_END

        CTN pg_config_param
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF state_1
            OBJECT_REF pg_param_1
        CTN_END
    CRI_END
DEF_END
